    "Scan of the 1964 edition of the Jacksonville Heights, Florida, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey and the Army Map Service. Aerial photographs from 1970; field checked in 1949; photo inspected in 1984; photo revised in 1978; last revised in 1978; printed in 1990.",
